fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4054690Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4163560Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4175201Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4175851Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4176607Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4176976Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4177325Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4178626Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4179103Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4179471Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4180342Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4180650Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4181289Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4182078Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4182594Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4183079Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4183259Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4183452Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4183745Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4183970Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4184379Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4184534Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4184654Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4184846Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4185158Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4185703Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4188966Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4189259Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4189500Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4189807Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4190638Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4191380Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4192051Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4192522Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4192984Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4193548Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4193976Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4204784Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4205579Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4217319Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4218070Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4218361Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4219325Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4219749Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
