fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4241425Z ^[[34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4252722Z ^[[0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T20:38:52.4253481Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
